{
 "description": "For calculation groups. T has three rows: Qty A 10, B 20, C 30. Measures: [Total] = SUM ( T[Qty] ) = 60, [Count] = COUNTROWS ( T ) = 3, [Ten] = 10. Calculation groups: Adjust[Adjustment] (precedence 100) with Current = SELECTEDMEASURE (), Plus 2 = SELECTEDMEASURE () + 2 and Only Total x10 (multiplies by 10 when the measure is [Total], otherwise leaves it); Scale[Scaling] (precedence 200) with Times 2 = SELECTEDMEASURE () * 2; Info[Info] (precedence 50) with Name = SELECTEDMEASURENAME ().",
 "tables": [
  {
